    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "27 Beech Lodge, Farmleigh Woods, Castleknock, Dublin 15\r\n**Elegant One-Bedroom Apartment in a Prestigious Castleknock Location**\r\n\r\nFor Sale by Susan Stewart, Dublin Homes Auctioneers**\r\n\r\nDublin Homes are delighted to present **27 Beech Lodge, Farmleigh Woods** to the market — an elegant and exceptionally well-positioned **one-bedroom, one-bathroom second-floor apartment**, situated in the prestigious Farmleigh Woods development in Castleknock.\r\n\r\nLight-filled, spacious and beautifully presented, this impressive apartment combines contemporary interiors with an enviable location close to **Castleknock Village, the Phoenix Park and Farmleigh House**.\r\n\r\nThe apartment enjoys **floor-to-ceiling windows**, creating a wonderful sense of space and filling the accommodation with natural light. The **westerly-facing balcony** is an excellent feature, overlooking landscaped gardens, it provides the perfect setting for morning coffee or relaxing with a glass of wine while enjoying the afternoon and evening sun.\r\n\r\nThe property also boasts an excellent **BER B2 rating**, adding to its appeal from both a comfort and energy-efficiency perspective and is therefore suitable for a Green Mortgage.\r\n\r\n**Elegant Interior**\r\n\r\nThe spacious living accommodation is bright and welcoming, with the floor-to-ceiling windows making the most of the apartment's elevated **second-floor position**. A **gas fire provides an attractive focal point in the living room**, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe **fully fitted kitchen** is both stylish and practical, featuring high-quality **Neff integrated appliances**, **granite worktops with matching upstand**, and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nThe bedroom is generously proportioned and provides a peaceful and comfortable retreat.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully appointed bathroom features a **full-size bath, concealed-cistern WC, contemporary floating wash hand basin and a stylish daisy-head shower**, creating a clean and sophisticated finish.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from **gas-fired central heating** .\r\n\r\n**Exceptional Parking & Storage**\r\n\r\nA particularly attractive feature of this apartment is the excellent provision for secure parking and storage.\r\n\r\nThe property comes with **permits for two cars in the secure underground car park**, together with an **allocated storage room** and, exceptionally, a **large double lock-up garage (Approx 22.08m²)**.\r\n\r\nThis level of secure parking and storage is a significant advantage and adds considerably to the property's appeal, particularly in such a sought-after Dublin location.\r\n\r\n**An Unrivalled Castleknock Location**\r\n\r\nFarmleigh Woods enjoys an enviable position in one of Castleknock's most prestigious and sought-after areas.\r\n\r\n**Castleknock Village is approximately 800 metres away**, providing an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities, while the surrounding area offers an abundance of recreational opportunities.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly special due to its proximity to the **Phoenix Park**, one of Europe's largest enclosed public parks, offering miles of open space, walking and cycling routes and beautiful parkland.\r\n\r\nNearby **Farmleigh House**, one of Dublin's most notable historic landmarks, adds to the prestige of the setting, with its historic estate, gardens and parkland providing an exceptional amenity on the doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe property's location within **Farmleigh Woods** offers a wonderful combination of mature surroundings, convenience and access to some of Dublin's finest recreational and cultural amenities.\r\n\r\n**A Superb Apartment in a Landmark Location**\r\n\r\n**27 Beech Lodge is an elegant, light-filled second-floor apartment offering excellent accommodation, superb parking and storage, and an exceptional location.**\r\n\r\nWith its **BER B2 rating, floor-to-ceiling windows, westerly-facing balcony, gas fire, fully fitted kitchen with Neff appliances, granite worktops and matching upstand, solid wood internal doors, quality bathroom finishes, permits for two cars, secure underground parking, allocated storage room and large double lock-up garage**, this is a property that offers considerably more than the typical one-bedroom apartment.\r\n\r\nIts proximity to **Castleknock Village, Farmleigh House and the Phoenix Park**, combined with the prestige of Farmleigh Woods, makes this an outstanding opportunity for a **first-time buyer, professional, downsizer or investor**.\r\n\r\n**Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality, space and exceptional setting of this superb apartment.**\r\n\r\n**Contact Susan Stewart, Dublin Homes Auctioneers, to arrange your viewing.**\r\nDisclaimer\r\n\r\nAll measurements, dimensions and floor plans provided are approximate and are intended for guidance purposes only.\r\n\r\nWhile every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars and in ensuring that the information provided is accurate and reliable, Dublin Homes Auctioneers makes no warranty or representation as to the completeness or accuracy of the information contained herein. Certain information may have been provided to us by the vendor or other third parties and, where applicable, has been included in good faith.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers are advised to satisfy themselves independently as to all matters relating to the property, including measurements, dimensions, boundaries, services, condition and any other information of importance to them. Professional advice should be obtained where appropriate.\r\n\r\nAccordingly, Dublin Homes Auctioneers accepts no liability for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies or misstatements contained in these particulars or in any associated online advertising, whether arising from information supplied by third parties or otherwise.\r\n\r\nProspective purchasers should not rely solely on these particulars and are advised to verify all information independently prior to entering into any contract or commitment in relation to the property."
